{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>&quot;Better not to open it\u2026&quot;</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s more terrifying - the daily grind against the backdrop of a creative crisis, or real monsters straight from Hell?<br>Live through the ordinary days of a writer tormented by the absence of inspiration. Take a shower, snack in front of the TV, try to write something... And soon, this routine will turn into pure horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/aa345076736506caf81e0a2c7ae54e79.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/aa345076736506caf81e0a2c7ae54e79.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/aa345076736506caf81e0a2c7ae54e79.mp4?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are Clark \u2014 a young and acclaimed writer whose debut novel became an international bestseller. Fame, money, recognition \u2014 he had it all. But now, a year has passed, and Clark hasn\u2019t written a single word. A relentless creative block consumes him from the inside. Alone in his luxurious mansion, he struggles to put even a sentence on paper\u2026 and fails every time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One sleepless night, the doorbell rings. On the porch, Clark finds a mysterious package with no sender. From that moment on, his life begins to spiral into a nightmare far darker than any writer\u2019s block.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What\u2019s inside the box? And more importantly\u2026 what happens once you open it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/4b29b0845931e5e28202a5a2c4475c3f.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/4b29b0845931e5e28202a5a2c4475c3f.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/4b29b0845931e5e28202a5a2c4475c3f.mp4?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u201cYou\u2019ve Got a Package\u201d</strong> is a short horror game in the walking simulator and exploration genre. You are about to live through the most nightmarish night of your life. Unspeakable horrors and terrors will crawl out from the darkness, eager to feast on your sticky fear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >By unleashing an ancient demon, you\u2019ll be dragged straight into a living Hell \u2014 and nothing will help you escape alive or unharmed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/7c6571f826469489f9af5cb21bde9f4f.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/7c6571f826469489f9af5cb21bde9f4f.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/7c6571f826469489f9af5cb21bde9f4f.mp4?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tight, concise gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic storytelling</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Creepy, unsettling atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive sound design that drags you into chaos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vivid and striking visuals</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No flashlights \u2014 everything unfolds in the light</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A vast variety of horrors guaranteed to give you chills</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/2be060afdd60ee02a5c61d17b859a263.poster.avif?t=1760978133\" width=568 height=320 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/extras/2be060afdd60ee02a5c61d17b859a263.webm?t=1760978133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game duration: 1 hour \u2013 1 hour 20 minutes</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4018200?t=1760978133","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/c34653cbf8627e6a8ad0c744f6b2f10ddd1dceaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1760978133","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/1ccdc24ad7f09f65c8e9d67547908056868788f6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760978133","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4018200/1ccdc24ad7f09f65c8e9d67547908056868788f6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760978133","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game contains scary moments, scenes of torture and violence."},"demos":[{"appid":4074570,"descrip